                {eventDetails.venueName}
              </h3>

              <p className="text-sm font-light leading-relaxed" style={{ color: theme.colors.textMuted }}>
                Situated along the tranquil banks of Lake Pichola, The Oberoi Udaivilas stands as a masterpiece of courtyards, serene reflecting pools, and traditional Rajasthani Mewari architectural splendor.
              </p>

